@startuml
' Alternative 5: simplified dependency/class relation view.

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

class "SeparationService" as Service <<Facade / Context>> #DCEBFF {
  +separate_uploaded_audio(...)
}

class "ModelService" as ModelService <<Model Selection>> #E4F7E7 {
  +get_model_for_separation(...)
}

class "SeparationAlgorithmFactory" as Factory <<Creator>> #E4F7E7 {
  +create(model)
}

interface "SeparationAlgorithm" as Algorithm <<Product / Strategy>> #FFF1CC {
  +separate(...)
}

class "NeoSSNetStrategy" as NeoSSNet <<ConcreteProduct / ConcreteStrategy>> #FFF1CC {
  +separate(...)
}

Service --> ModelService : depends on
Service --> Factory : depends on
Service --> Algorithm : depends on abstraction
Factory ..> Algorithm : returns
Factory ..> NeoSSNet : instantiates
NeoSSNet ..|> Algorithm

note bottom
  Dependency view:
  high-level workflow depends on abstractions and focused services.
end note

@enduml
